.github/dependabot.yml:8:15: "password" of registry "dockerhub" is written in plain text. store it as a Dependabot secret and write ${{secrets.NAME}} instead, and rotate the credential because it is in the history of the repository [hardcoded-registry-credentials]
.github/dependabot.yml:13:12: "token" of registry "npm-github" is written in plain text. store it as a Dependabot secret and write ${{secrets.NAME}} instead, and rotate the credential because it is in the history of the repository [hardcoded-registry-credentials]
.github/dependabot.yml:18:10: "key" of registry "hex-org" is written in plain text. store it as a Dependabot secret and write ${{secrets.NAME}} instead, and rotate the credential because it is in the history of the repository [hardcoded-registry-credentials]
.github/dependabot.yml:24:15: "auth-key" of registry "hex-repo" is written in plain text. store it as a Dependabot secret and write ${{secrets.NAME}} instead, and rotate the credential because it is in the history of the repository [hardcoded-registry-credentials]
.github/dependabot.yml:29:10: "url" of registry "maven" has a password in plain text. remove it from the URL, set "username" and "password" with ${{secrets.NAME}} instead, and rotate the credential because it is in the history of the repository [hardcoded-registry-credentials]
